      "created_at": "2014-01-10T16:53:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That actually was the question, thanks.&nbsp; I guess I'm just having a hard time getting it, maybe if I played it it would register.&nbsp; Thank you for your thorough explanation!</p><p>So basicially if the environment runs out of cards and has to shuffle - you're toast.&nbsp; Well, no, the environment deck <strong><em>won't</em></strong> run out because it gets fed a card from the discard pile every turn.&nbsp;</p><p>So in a worst-case scenario you&nbsp;have two turns to beat the villian or you lose.&nbsp; That could be tough!</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
