      "created_at": "2014-01-10T17:29:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The mechanic also includes a \"mixed blessing\" in terms of the Explosives Wagons. &nbsp;They provide a flat +1 to all damage buff (to all sides), though you may have to end up destroying them to keep the portal open, or by accident (i.e. effects that deal damage to all targets or all non-hero/non-villain targets). &nbsp;If brought to 0 hp, they explode, dealing tons of damage to everything in the game! &nbsp;Ouch!</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:10:17.573Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
